Per the audit in our discussion:

- `database-service.ts:319 evaluateLevelUp()` — relies on accuracy field that's always 0. Delete.
- `user-service.ts:69` syncUserStats hardcoded reset of `nextLevelProgress` to 0 with the "will be calculated" comment. Replace with no-op (the field is owned by the rating-points logic now).
- `HomeScreen.tsx:70` static formula `Math.round(workoutHistory.length / threshold * 100)`. Delete — the value is owned by the rating-points logic.
- `user-service.ts:93 getRecommendedLevel()` — repurpose for the Profile demotion hint instead of its current unused state.

